{"id":"cabine","lemma":"cabine","pos":"noun","rank":2074,"glosses":["cabin (aeroplane)"],"ipa":"/ka.bin/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b7/Fr-cabine.ogg/Fr-cabine.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"cabines"},"formAudio":{"cabines":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2e/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-cabines.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Où est la cabine d'essayage ?","en":"Where's the fitting room?","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"fitting, trying on"}]},{"text":"La cabine sentait le moisi.","en":"The cabin smelled musty.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to smell","l":"sentir"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"mouldy"}]},{"text":"Tom n'est pas dans la cabine.","en":"Tom isn't in the cabin.","words":[null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Je voudrais essayer ça. Où sont les cabines d'essayage?","en":"I'd like to try this on. Where are the fitting rooms?","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"to test, to try on"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"where"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"fitting, trying on"}]},{"text":"Pouvez-vous me dire où se trouve la cabine téléphonique la plus proche ?","en":"Can you tell me where the nearest pay phone is?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to say, to tell"},{"g":"where"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to find","l":"trouver"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"telephone"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"more / no longer"},{"g":"close"}]}]}